eight="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path></svg></span> <h3>Analytics</h3> <p>Occupancy, retention, lifetime value, instructor performance and growth — beautifully visualized.</p> <div class="bmock"> <div class="spark"><i style="height:30%"></i><i style="height:45%"></i><i style="height:38%"></i><i style="height:60%"></i><i style="height:52%"></i><i style="height:74%"></i><i class="hi" style="height:92%"></i></div> </div> </div> <!-- Staff / one more to balance grid --> <div class="bcard rv"> <span class="bic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21v-1a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v1"></path></svg></span> <h3>Staff Portal</h3> <p>Schedules, payroll, commission rules and performance — every instructor gets their own login.</p> <div class="bmock"> <div class="mrow"><i class="mava" style="background:#0ea5e9">JD</i> Jane D. <span class="mtag g">12 classes</span></div> <div class="mrow"><i class="mava" style="background:#8b5cf6">MR</i> Marco R. <span class="mtag o">Payroll ready</span></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ═══════════ SHOWCASE ═══════════ --> <section class="showcase" id="showcase"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="center rv"> <span class="tag">See it in action</span> <h2 class="h2">One product. Every screen your studio runs on.</h2> <p class="sub">Click through the actual product surfaces — from the owner dashboard to the client mobile experience.</p> </div> <div class="tabs rv" id="tabs"></div> <div class="laptop rv"> <div class="screen"> <div class="dash-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span id="scrTitle">studionexis — dashboard</span></div> <div class="slider" id="slider"></div> </div> <div class="base"></div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ═══════════ WHY ═══════════ --> <section class="why"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="center rv"> <span class="tag">Why Studio Nexis</span> <h2 class="h2">One login. One platform.<br>Zero headaches.</h2> <p class="sub">Instead of juggling six different systems, Studio Nexis combines everything into one seamless experience.</p> </div> <div class="why-grid"> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">⏱️</span><h4>Save hours every week</h4><p>Admin that used to take evenings now takes minutes.</p></div> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">📉</span><h4>Reduce admin work</h4><p>Automations handle reminders, renewals and follow-ups.</p></div> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">📈</span><h4>Increase bookings</h4><p>Online booking and waitlists fill every spot automatically.</p></div> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">💛</span><h4>Improve retention</h4><p>Win-backs, birthday rewards and VIP programs built in.</p></div> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">🤖</span><h4>Automate the repetitive</h4><p>From check-in to review request — hands-free.</p></div> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">💰</span><h4>Grow revenue</h4><p>Upsells, packages and memberships that sell themselves.</p></div> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">🧭</span><h4>Decide with data</h4><p>Know your occupancy, LTV and margins at a glance.</p></div> <div class="wcard rv"><span class="bic">🔐</span><h4>One secure login</h4><p>Owners, staff and clients — each with the right access.</p></div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ═══════════ AUTOMATION (dark) ═══════════ --> <section class="auto"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="center rv"> <span class="tag">Automation</span> <h2 class="h2" style="color:#fff">Your studio, on autopilot.</h2> <p class="sub" style="margin:0 auto">One booking sets off a chain of touchpoints — no human required.</p> </div> <div class="flow"> <div class="fnode rv"><span class="ci">📅</span><div><b>Booking</b><small>Client books Group Reformer, 09:30</small></div></div> <div class="fline"></div> <div class="fnode rv"><span class="ci">✉️</span><div><b>Confirmation email</b><small>Instant, on-brand</small></di