s, waitlist spots and studio news.</p></div></div> </div> </div> <div class="phones rv"> <div class="phone p1"><div class="ph-in"> <div class="ph-head"><b>Book a class</b><p>Tuesday, March 12</p></div> <div class="ph-body"> <div class="ph-card"><b>07:00 · Group Reformer</b><small>Jane D. · 2 spots left</small></div> <div class="ph-card" style="border-color:var(--or3);background:var(--or-bg)"><b>09:30 · Mat Pilates</b><small>Marco R. · 4 spots left</small></div> <div class="ph-card"><b>17:30 · Yoga Flow</b><small>Emma S. · Waitlist</small></div> <div class="ph-btn">Book 09:30 →</div> </div> </div></div> <div class="phone p2"><div class="ph-in"> <div class="ph-head"><b>My membership</b><p>Anna Lee</p></div> <div class="ph-body"> <div class="ph-card"><div class="cred-ring"><span class="ring"><i>7/10</i></span><div><b>10 Class Pack</b><small>Valid until Jun 30</small></div></div></div> <div class="ph-card"><b>Next: Group Reformer</b><small>Tomorrow · 07:00</small></div> <div class="ph-btn" style="background:#1c1917">Show check-in card</div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ═══════════ TESTIMONIALS ═══════════ --> <section class="testi"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="center rv"> <span class="tag">Loved by owners</span> <h2 class="h2">Studios run better on Nexis.</h2> </div> <div class="tgrid"> <div class="tcard rv"> <div class="tstat" data-count="18" data-suffix=" hrs">18 hrs<small>saved every week</small></div> <p>"I used to spend my Sundays on spreadsheets and payment chasing. Nexis gave me my weekends back — everything just happens."</p> <div class="twho"><span class="tava" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f97316,#ea580c)">LM</span><div><b>Lena Moreau</b><small>Founder, Reform House</small></div></div> </div> <div class="tcard rv"> <div class="tstat" data-count="37" data-suffix="%">37%<small>more bookings</small></div> <p>"Online booking with waitlists changed everything. Classes fill themselves, and the win-back emails bring quiet clients back."</p> <div class="twho"><span class="tava" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#6d28d9)">DK</span><div><b>Daniel Kim</b><small>Owner, Core Society</small></div></div> </div> <div class="tcard rv"> <div class="tstat">↓ 70%<small>front-desk admin</small></div> <p>"Our front desk work dropped dramatically. Check-ins, payments and credits are one screen — new staff learn it in a day."</p> <div class="twho"><span class="tava" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#0369a1)">AS</span><div><b>Ava Sørensen</b><small>Director, Studio North</small></div></div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ═══════════ PRICING ═══════════ --> <section class="pricing" id="pricing"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="center rv"> <span class="tag">Pricing</span> <h2 class="h2">Simple pricing that grows with you.</h2> <p class="sub">Every plan includes unlimited bookings, the mobile experience and support. No booking fees, ever.</p> </div> <div class="pgrid"> <div class="pcard rv"> <div class="pname">Starter</div> <div class="pfor">For new studios finding their feet</div> <div class="pprice">$29<small>/month</small></div> <div class="pfeats"> <span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Unlimited bookings</span> <span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Client CRM</span> <span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>POS & payments</span> <span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Studio website</span> <span><svg width="15" height="15" vie