tion and instructors each get their own login with role-based permissions, schedules and payroll.</p></details> <details class="qa"><summary>Do you charge booking fees?</summary><p>Never. You pay one flat monthly subscription — every booking, client and class is included with zero per-transaction platform fees.</p></details> <details class="qa"><summary>Can I use my own Stripe account?</summary><p>Yes — connect your own Stripe account and payments settle directly to you. Sandbox mode lets you start taking bookings before payments are connected.</p></details> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ═══════════ FINAL CTA ═══════════ --> <section class="final"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="cta-box rv"> <span class="cta-chip" style="top:26px;left:34px">📅 24 New Bookings</span> <span class="cta-chip" style="top:60px;right:44px;animation-delay:1.2s">📈 +42% Revenue</span> <span class="cta-chip" style="bottom:34px;left:60px;animation-delay:2s">⭐ 4.9 Average rating</span> <span class="cta-chip" style="bottom:52px;right:70px;animation-delay:.6s">💳 Payment received</span> <h2>Your studio deserves better software.</h2> <p>Spend less time managing your business and more time growing it.</p> <div class="acts"> <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/signup">Start Free Trial</a> <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="#showcase">Book a Demo</a> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ═══════════ FOOTER ═══════════ --> <footer> <div class="wrap"> <div class="fgrid"> <div class="fcol"> <a class="logo" href="/" style="margin-bottom:14px"><span class="logo-mark">N</span>Studio&nbsp;Nexis</a> <p style="max-width:260px">The all-in-one operating system for modern pilates & yoga studios.</p> </div> <div class="fcol"> <h5>Product</h5> <a href="#features">Features</a> <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a> <a href="#showcase">Product tour</a> <a href="/signup">Integrations</a> <a href="/signup">API</a> </div> <div class="fcol"> <h5>Resources</h5> <a href="#faq">FAQ</a> <a href="/signup">Blog</a> <a href="/sign